@startuml SD-UC-K04_PerbaruiBerita
title Sequence Diagram UC-K04: Memperbarui Berita (Admin)
skinparam style strictuml

actor Admin
boundary HalamanDaftarBerita
boundary HalamanUbahBerita
control UbahBeritaController
entity Berita
database beritas

activate Admin

Admin -> HalamanUbahBerita : Klik "Perbarui Berita"
activate HalamanUbahBerita

HalamanUbahBerita -> UbahBeritaController : ubahBerita(request: Request, id_berita: int)
activate UbahBeritaController

UbahBeritaController -> UbahBeritaController : validate(request: Request)
UbahBeritaController -> Berita : Berita::where(id_berita).update(data: Array)
activate Berita

Berita -> beritas : UPDATE beritas SET ...
activate beritas

beritas --> Berita : return(berita: Berita)
deactivate beritas

Berita --> UbahBeritaController : return(berita: Berita)
deactivate Berita

UbahBeritaController --> HalamanUbahBerita : response(data: Array)
deactivate UbahBeritaController

HalamanUbahBerita --> Admin : Tampilkan notifikasi berhasil
HalamanUbahBerita -> HalamanDaftarBerita : router.push('/admin/berita')
deactivate HalamanUbahBerita
activate HalamanDaftarBerita

HalamanDaftarBerita -> Admin : Tampilkan daftar berita terbaru
deactivate HalamanDaftarBerita
deactivate Admin

@enduml